      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/65/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1de398beeafaf8e39e2eca60",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "结果那天工作一项项地冒出来，\n后来不得已延后训练开始的时间──",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5623bddc34f8fdc705b5e5af8bf4e8078f3e3bc937f66f1e0c69433b22a5959",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        66,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/66/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:976983ddb83b59aa0c46af5e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是鲁道夫象征仍然确实地，\n完成了预定的训练量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fd24a5149bb4022d0bf80398fcf856ffbf30a849bdd13c64a58654b6bb63e0f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        67,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/67/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b177f6cdc501386c65f4a7e5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba58fa29016f4366679b31c483127417c7d74c51f8dbea2e0de6e4b65088d5e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab7f57c86f27a9a7300c449a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我是指挑选陪我并跑练习的人啊。\n让你遇上颇大的困难了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0ac285a100d20b3a300a20bdd14e087f3eca4b31e3978c5f6211ce8145a271f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bc32febb521a39a28a7eb8f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……没错。一提到对手是“皇帝”，\n所有人都惶恐地说自己做不来，\n完全没有人愿意帮忙。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3df562d96b0460cdbe2bd6a02143fc6e4be46bc0b1f38ce90e9611876a00ab7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:099664740125822b95980f03",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最后一再拜托认识的训练员，\n好不容易才找到一个人……",
      "source_fingerprint": "59c36c1553f76537ab634b4c2c1472363f7aa2b981c5a161ad71d066de62c8e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
