    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:305db1fc678a35f75e13e6f7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一月即将来到尾声，\n年初繁忙的生活也终于渐渐和缓下来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d7c21e792d70a3c0772fb4683002d06c24006658e819fb676a1022eb6bd6bb6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a1720566226de6af321e9d7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了与鲁道夫象征讨论训练方针，\n我按照她说的来到学生宿舍接她。\n就在这时……",
      "source_fingerprint": "027f32dcd5573f1b48fe6e0ebd5dd200891574afd00143eec2a1c652c536f3be",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b46de3dac555715b8314bb7b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过一月都快要结束了，\n没想到还有学生没回到学园。\n当我独自感到疑惑时──",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cc91b41bf360c6dda79d7068ce5434325c5b554b0d55bafa6339ef6a4111249",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d262702a54cffa188e83af82",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba58fa29016f4366679b31c483127417c7d74c51f8dbea2e0de6e4b65088d5e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017116.json",
      "json_path": [
